+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CHQ> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Quartz-dolerite with subsidiary augite diorite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Paleogene Period (66-23.04 Ma BP)."@en .
